# Gabriel Overview Doc

- Keep `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md` aligned with bootstrap injection
  (`GabrielBootstrap.sessionPlugins`) and `GabrielSessionPlugins.cslist` membership
  when those change in a user-visible way.
- When adding a new `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/features/*/` area, add a row to
  `FEATURE.md` and ensure that folder has its own `FEATURE.md`.
- If the change crosses into a specific feature, still update the adjacent
  `features/*/FEATURE.md` for that area.
